  "description": "Hi all,\n\nFirst attempt modder here\n\nThis mod adds a 10 ship faction to the vanilla game, along with a station orbiting Corvus IV as their main base\n\nThe ships are mostly balanced through my own testing as well as keptin's shipbalance suite, but that is as of 0.51 and testing was not that comprehensive so feel free to post here if anything feels imba\n\nas is the station has no supply convoys, will add them as soon as I know how.\n\nSprites from GSB (Gratuitous Space Battles) by Positech Games, used with their permission.\n\nDownload v1.1 here:\nhttp://www.mediafire.com/?6ih3vlflbovblu6\n\nEDIT:pics\n\nships:\n\nSpoiler\nValkyria class Battleship\n\nMinotaur class Heavy Cruiser (with carrier variant)\n\nValhalla class Cruiser\n\nFenrir class Destroyer\n\nMidgard class Destroyer\n\nAsgard class Battle Frigate\n\nOdin class Assault Frigate\n\nLoki class Light Frigate\n\nAtlantis class Bomber\n\nAchilles class Fighter\n\nPheonix class Interceptor\n\naction pictures:\n\nSpoiler\nValhalla class Cruiser with escorts\n\nOdin class Frigate with bombers\n\nPheonix interceptor in action\n\nValhalla under attack\n\nValhalla in combat\n\nValkyria class Battleship\n\nValkyria in combat\n\nValkyria taking fire\n\n(moderator edit: added link to Positech's site, as a courtesy to them)",
  "descriptionHtml": "Hi all, <br><br>First attempt modder here<br><br>This mod adds a 10 ship faction to the vanilla game, along with a station orbiting Corvus IV as their main base<br><br>The ships are mostly balanced through my own testing as well as keptin's shipbalance suite, but that is as of 0.51 and testing was not that comprehensive so feel free to post here if anything feels imba<br><br>as is the station has no supply convoys, will add them as soon as I know how.<br><br>Sprites from GSB (<a href=\"http://positech.co.uk/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Gratuitous Space Battles</a>) by Positech Games, used with their permission.<br><br>Download v1.1 here:<br><a href=\"http://www.mediafire.com/?6ih3vlflbovblu6\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.mediafire.com/?6ih3vlflbovblu6</a><br><br>EDIT:pics<br><br>ships:<br><details class=\"spoiler\"><summary>Spoiler</summary>Valkyria class Battleship<br><a href=\"http://www.mediafire.com/imageview.php?thumb=5&amp;quickkey=cqjsz8bf350r7z4\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"http://www.mediafire.com/conv/14f4329a156f09a5035ec17424de62553c7c684da2918b8a4e25028ece1eaed04g.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></a><br><br>Minotaur class Heavy Cruiser (with carrier variant)<br><a href=\"http://www.mediafire.com/imageview.php?thumb=5&amp;quickkey=jmf6crgfgeh55m4\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"http://www.mediafire.com/conv/974b701e1bb8386b2cb6fbabd20e2c1d62a5c2287fe6264e979a1ca694a45be74g.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></a><br><br>Valhalla class Cruiser<br><a href=\"http://www.mediafire.com/imageview.php?thumb=5&amp;quickkey=42jzvja5jb1tdsz\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"http://www.mediafire.com/conv/37be55d89b02d4e10c64d42953d96f1392bcc6a57bf5e314dcac83cdf56782724g.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></a><br><br>Fenrir class Destroyer<br><a href=\"http://www.mediafire.com/imageview.php?thumb=5&amp;quickkey=ujxnhseavc2h3ig\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"http://www.mediafire.com/conv/b39e1573099ca263b23e618ff1b0f8373e7193057a691e680af61db47d57e1d24g.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></a><br><br>Midgard class Destroyer<br><a href=\"http://www.mediafire.com/imageview.php?thumb=5&amp;quickkey=4hkcs5jikb9ibqw\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"http://www.mediafire.com/conv/846929efc284788c21b0b08218680a0f517130ca1073cc209aa4aeb5febd414f4g.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></a><br><br>Asgard class Battle Frigate<br><a href=\"http://www.mediafire.com/imageview.php?thumb=5&amp;quickkey=131vbw8ovahwlp3\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"http://www.mediafire.com/conv/031596f0078d512a6bb15e00dd93baa125a290a586fabcf797b0f886de2196474g.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></a><br><br>Odin class Assault Frigate<br><a href=\"http://www.mediafire.com/imageview.php?thumb=5&amp;quickkey=0i9pc5brq3bo560\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"http://www.mediafire.com/conv/b6164fefd76aef6a0ab638ac186440ed6de4399b8907958877aebb6f337fdb344g.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></a><br><br>Loki class Light Frigate<br><a href=\"http://www.mediafire.com/imageview.php?thumb=5&amp;quickkey=txv15bxhyx4dya2\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"http://www.mediafire.com/conv/dd32b1f2b94188ec28f24476a5ccec5464376e0f12beb83972d9d8b2141bcb944g.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></a><br><br>Atlantis class Bomber<br><a href=\"http://www.mediafire.com/imageview.php?thumb=5&amp;quickkey=s764db6uut06di0\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\"